<p class="lede">
  After moving to California, William and Harriet Lanterman subdivided their
  residential lot and added a smaller residence at this address in 1923.
</p>

<p>
  More about the family and the two residences is available in the
  <a href="/biographies/william-a-lanterman/">William A. Lanterman biography</a>.
</p>

<aside class="notice">
  <strong>Date discrepancy:</strong>
  the sign dates this home to 1900, while the existing record dates the smaller
  residence at this address to 1923. Both claims are retained pending
  historical review.
</aside>

